# UI & Styling Rules

## Tailwind CSS

- Version 3 with JIT mode
- Dark mode: `class` strategy (used in app interior, not on public pages)
- Always use utility classes; avoid custom CSS except for animations

## Brand Palette

| Name | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| Blue | `#0E83DC` | Primary buttons, links, active states |
| Dark Slate | `#485E72` | Body text, headings, secondary buttons |
| Green | `#69A748` | Success indicators, checkmarks, publish |
| Light Gray | `#C0C5C0` | Borders, dividers, muted backgrounds |
| Page BG | `#F4F6F8` | Public page backgrounds |

## Public Pages Theme

- Background: `bg-[#F4F6F8]`
- Text: `text-[#485E72]`
- Cards: `bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#C0C5C0]/30 rounded-2xl`
- Hover cards: `hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#485E72]/[0.06] hover:-translate-y-1`
- Primary buttons: `bg-[#0E83DC] text-white shadow-lg shadow-[#0E83DC]/20 hover:bg-[#0b6fbf] rounded-xl`
- Secondary buttons: `border-2 border-[#C0C5C0]/60 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm text-[#485E72] rounded-xl`
- Links: `text-[#0E83DC] hover:text-[#0b6fbf]`
- Muted text: `text-[#485E72]/60`
- Badges: `rounded-full border bg-[color]/5 text-[color] text-xs font-semibold px-4 py-1.5`

## shadcn/ui

- Style: **new-york**
- Import from `@/components/ui/`
- CSS variables defined in `resources/css/app.css` under `:root` and `.dark`
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for merging classes

## Animation Classes

Available custom animation utilities (defined in `resources/css/app.css`):
- `.animate-fade-in` — fade in 0.6s
- `.animate-fade-in-up` — fade in + slide up 0.7s (starts with `opacity: 0`)
- `.animate-pulse-slow` — gentle pulse 4s infinite

## Icons

- Only **Lucide React** — never mix icon libraries
- Consistent sizing per context:
  - Nav items: `h-3.5 w-3.5`
  - Feature cards: `h-5 w-5` with `strokeWidth={1.8}`
  - Hero icons: `h-6 w-6`
  - Section badges: `h-3.5 w-3.5`

## Spacing & Layout

- Max width for content: `max-w-6xl mx-auto`
- Section padding: `px-6 py-24 sm:py-32`
- Card padding: `p-6`
- Gap between cards: `gap-5`
- Border radius: `rounded-2xl` for cards, `rounded-xl` for buttons, `rounded-full` for badges

## Glass Morphism Pattern

```
bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#C0C5C0]/30
```

## Responsive

- Mobile-first approach
- Breakpoints: `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`
- Mobile menu at `md:` breakpoint
- Grid: `grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4`
